{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvTGllLXRvLUxvdmUtMjAyMS8","type":"series","name":"Lie to Love","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/sogyrB1s0xQVs9GDkIe8xa1MITK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3cpkIuEcKh4vHjDNSIaohL3wKRp.jpg","description":"Li Zeiliang, the sunny and carefree heir to a conglomerate, meets the bright and bubbly Su Xieyi. They are swept into a passionate romance to spend the most unforgettable moments of their lives together. With so many entanglements, are they destined to be together or are they destined to part? An unexpected development has left the life that Su Xieyi has come to know in shambles and has destroyed her family. All clues point to her lover Li Zeliang as the instigator. In order to investigate the truth, Su Xieyi pretends to have amnesia to return to Li Zeliang's arms. In the dangerous game of love, she treads every step carefully while Li Zeliang hits rock bottom. As the truth is revealed little by little, Su Xieyi is surprised to learn that she has wrongfully blamed Li Zeliang all this time and tries desperately to save their relationship.\n\nEnded · First aired 30 Nov 2021 · China · Language: Chinese · 40 min\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 32/32\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Drama","Comedy","Mystery","Korean"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvTGllLXRvLUxvdmUtMjAyMS8.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2021-11-30T00:00:00.000Z","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ap9YwGzbohYQHAPHk4YWAtogvFs.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvTGllLXRvLUxvdmUtMjAyMS8.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2021-11-30T00:00:00.000Z","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3saXIUiismPYi9RPGDXEpZVl4q2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVH